    "settings": [
     "S34"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "187e6244 with the lead car 1.5 s late at 0.75x and the ego at 0.8x is the best unconfirmed candidate, and the policy is at fault there. The ego took over about 2 m behind lead car 48, did not slow enough and hit it from behind. It then swerved left against a RIGHT command and scraped car 7. Its range still reaches below 0.5.",
